From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emaki contributors <emaki@localhost>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 01:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add the Emaki animated overview backdrop

Draw smooth eight-piece chaos rings behind workspace backgrounds, replacing
rings with pixel chevrons during held navigation and for 140 ms after input.
Count camera-moving actions and boundary attempts; keep rings at the fixed
resting slot through zoom. Use monotonic effect time, stable ring colours,
portable GLES selectors, retained uniforms, and no effect redraws when closed.
Compile the Emaki defaults; allow overrides/off only in fork configurations.
Keep lock, capture exclusion, screenshot UI and startup-cover ordering.

Generated with git diff d7d6fac6; no commit or index mutation.
